<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (Care-Based Safety \(CBS\) is a community-rooted organisation working to replace punishment-based responses with care-centred approaches to safety. Grounded in abolitionist principles and led by the belief that safety is relational, CBS builds and advocates for non-police crisis response, prevention-first systems, and community-led solutions. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
201 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (CBS communicates with warmth, clarity, and conviction. Our voice is compassionate yet firm, future-oriented yet grounded in real community needs. Through accessible language, relational imagery, and people-first storytelling, we demonstrate that care-based safety is not only possible, but practical and effective. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
