205 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 161 0 R
/E (The CBS symbol is designed to evoke warmth, ease, and a sense of breathing room. Its radiating circular form communicates safety and care without relying on traditional policing symbols. Instead, the expanding beams create a feeling of openness and shared energy, reflecting the belief that safety grows from community rather than enforcement. At the centre sits a single point representing community as the core of safety, from which care and support radiate outward. The hand-drawn, expressive strokes introduce humanity, reflecting lived experience.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
